      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاكُورَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A piece of land retained and enclosed
by its proprietor</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحكر</span> [i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تُحَكَّرُ</span>]) <i>for sowing</i>
[<i>and planting</i>] <i>trees</i> [<i>&amp;c.</i>], <i>near to the houses
and abodes:</i> of the dial. of Syria. (TA.) [See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِكْرٌ</span>.]

